  "bodyHtml": "<section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Expertise</p>\n                            <h2>Software ecodesign and performance experts at the service of your project</h2>\n                            <p>Audit of an existing or redesigned application, improvement support,\n                                Greenspector Certificate: our teams support you end to end.</p>\n                            <p>Contact us to speak directly with our experts or our certified\n                                partners.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/page_services_2_d6aa16ab.svg\" alt=\"Greenspector support on digital services\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Getting started</p>\n                        <h2>Audit an application</h2>\n                        <p><strong>The frugality, environmental impact and performance audit</strong> with\n                            Greenspector Studio is an excellent starting point to structure your approach.</p>\n                        <p><strong>Describe the user journey, we take care of the rest</strong>:\n                            automation, test execution, results analysis and recommendations report.</p>\n                        <p>You then have a concrete action plan to reduce the impacts of your\n                            application.</p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Certificate</p>\n                            <h2>Le Certificate Greenspector de Sobriété de Service Numérique</h2>\n                            <p>The certificate is awarded to mobile applications and websites that combine energy\n                                frugality, data frugality and performance.</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li><strong>Energy frugality on user device</strong>: to reduce\n                                    quality risks, improve inclusion and reduce impacts.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Data consumption frugality</strong>: to reduce environmental\n                                    footprint and facilitate mobile usage.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Performance</strong>: to limit footprint while improving UX.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <p>Measurements are grouped, analysed then converted to scores. <strong>An ecoscore from\n                                    0 to 100 summarises the whole</strong>, with three certificate levels: Bronze\n                                (50-69), Silver (70-89), Gold (90-100).</p>\n                            <p>A badge displayable on your site or in your application is linked to an authentication\n                                page hosted by us.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/certificat_aef88bd1.png\" alt=\"Exemple de Certificate de Sobriété de Service Numérique Greenspector\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">What they say</p>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>Being supported by a player like Greenspector means making sure you don't go\n                                down the wrong path or take shortcuts.</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/HPhan-150x150_742237e7.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Hoang-Anh Phan\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>Hoang-Anh Phan</strong>\n                                    <span>Responsible Digital Project Manager, Jalios</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading standards</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised for its environmental efficiency.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>Expertise built on research and field feedback.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Standards compatibility</h3>\n                                <p>LCA (ISO 14040), Green Software Foundation SCI, ADEME RCP and related references.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio</h2>\n                        <p>To combine environmental responsibility, user satisfaction and application\n                            performance.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_regionbretagne_b8829f76.jpg\" alt=\"Région Bretagne logo\"></figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>"
